# Cross-Border Network & Overseas Social Media Handbook

[中文版 README](./README.md) | **English**

An open, practical engineering handbook for cross-border e-commerce sellers, overseas social media teams (TikTok, YouTube, Instagram), and developers. Covers clean residential IP auditing, OpenWrt soft router multi-device isolation, TikTok live streaming network optimization, VPS route selection (CN2 GIA / 9929 / CMIN2), and AI tool anti-ban setups.

> Online diagnostic console, client downloads, and full guides: **[LGG CHINA (lggchina.com)](https://lggchina.com/)**

