## Quick Start: One-Line Network & AI Environment Audit

Run our read-only shell script (`scripts/check-env.sh`) on Linux or macOS to inspect your exit IPv4, ASN, IPv6 leak status, OpenAI/Claude region trace, and Linux TCP BBR status:

```bash
bash scripts/check-env.sh
```

